Explanation of the patch:

- We keep the existing environment loop intact.
- Just before `return header;` we check for `report.runtimeWarnings`.
- For each warning string we create a `<div class="lh-note">…</div>`, which leverages the existing “note” styling in the report.
- We append each of these under the cloned header, so the warning appears immediately beneath the URL/UA/timestamp row (and above the category gauges).
